# r1-wheel, the scroll wheel as r1-wheeld (wheel/daemon) sends it on, the keys of its modes:
# taskbar (NAVIGATE_*: the policy gives them to SystemUI's wheel taskbar while an app is in
# front, r1-wheel.kcm makes them D-pad steps in system windows), app, tab, arrows, page,
# volume, brightness, media and zoom. Scroll goes through r1-wheel-touch.

key 12    MINUS
key 13    EQUALS
key 15    TAB
key 29    CTRL_LEFT
key 42    SHIFT_LEFT
key 103   DPAD_UP
key 104   PAGE_UP
key 105   DPAD_LEFT
key 106   DPAD_RIGHT
key 108   DPAD_DOWN
key 109   PAGE_DOWN
key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 163   MEDIA_NEXT
key 165   MEDIA_PREVIOUS
key 177   NAVIGATE_PREVIOUS
key 178   NAVIGATE_NEXT
key 224   BRIGHTNESS_DOWN
key 225   BRIGHTNESS_UP
